  "priorExpiration": "2010-03-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2304.01 Taxpayer Records and Information. Every hospital liable for the medicaid enhancement tax shall maintain all accounting, financial or general records and information necessary to establish the amount of net patient services revenue or other information required to be shown on any return, schedule or attachment.\n\nSource. #5166, Emergency, eff 6-21-91, EXPIRED: 10-19-91\n\nNew. #5335, eff 2-26-92, EXPIRED: 2-26-98\n\nNew. #7746, eff 8-17-02, EXPIRED: 8-17-10\n\nNew. #9794, INTERIM, eff 9-24-10, EXPIRED: 3-23-10\n\nNew. #9913, eff 4-21-11; ss by #12823, eff 7-4-19",
